<title>USA: Atlantic Beverage acquires sausage maker.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Beverage acquires sausage maker.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Beverage Co Inc said Friday it acquired the businesses of privately held Grogan's Country Sausage, based in Arlington, Ky.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Grogan's manufactures and distributes pork sausage products in a region that includes six contiguous states.</p>
<p>Atlantic Beverage manufactures, markets and distributes meat products and, through its beverage division, distributes juices, natural sodas and bottled waters.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
